The startx is 1, while the starty is 1.
The targetx is 3, while the targety is 5.
The reachable is 0.
Repeat while targetx is more than startx and targety is more than starty.
If targetx is more than targety, set targetx to targetx modulo targety, otherwise set targety to targety modulo targetx.

If targetx is startx and targety is at least starty.
The gap is targety minus starty.
If gap modulo startx is 0, set reachable to 1.

If targety is starty and targetx is at least startx.
The gap is targetx minus startx.
If gap modulo starty is 0, set reachable to 1.

If reachable is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
